                    <tr> 
                      <td colspan="6" height="6"> 
                        <div align="justify"> 
                          <p><b><font face="Arial" size="2">EFFECTIVE NOVEMBER 
                            1, 2002, THE U.S. DEPARTMENT OF STATE IS RAISING THE 
                            WORLDWIDE NONIMMIGRANT VISA FEE FROM $ 65 TO $ 100. 
                            </font></b></p>
                          <p><b><font face="Arial" size="2">THIS ADJUSTMENT WILL 
                            BRING THE FEE INTO LINE WITH THE ACTUAL COSTS OF ADMINISTERING 
                            NONIMMIGRANT VISA SERVICES.</font></b></p>
                          <p><b><font face="Arial" size="2">ADDED SECURITY SCREENING 
                            PROCEDURE, RESTRICTIONS ON THE ROLE OF SUPPORT STAFF, 
                            AND FURTHER INCREASES IN MANAGEMENT OVERSIGHT HAVE 
                            ADDED TO THE COST OF NONIMMIGRANT VISA PROCESSING. 
                            </font></b><b><font face="Arial" size="2"><br>
                            &nbsp; </font></b></p>
                        </div>
                      </td>
                    </tr>
