                    <tr> 
                      <td colspan="6" height="2"> 
                        <div align="justify"> 
                          <p><font face="Arial" size="2"><b>AS PER RECENT NOTIFICATION 
                            FROM THE 'PROTECTORATE OF EMMIGRANTS' - WITH EFFECT 
                            FROM 28TH NOVEMBER 2002, A PROCESSING FEE OF RS. 100/- 
                            WILL BE CHARGED FOR THE POE SUSPENSION IN PASSPORT.</b></font></p>
                          <p><b><font face="Arial" size="2">ALSO THE REVISED FEE 
                            FOR THE ECNR FOR EMPLOYMENT WILL BE RS. 200/- INSTEAD 
                            OF RS. 100/- CHARGED EARLIER. </font></b></p>
                          <p><b><font face="Arial" size="2">KINDLY BE APPRISED 
                            THAT THE ABOVE ARE IN ADDITION TO THE CHARGES PAID 
                            TO OUR AUTHORISED AGENTS FOR POE SUSPENSION. </font></b></p>
